  UnitStory: "Slender Man l\xE0 m\u1ED9t nh\xE2n v\u1EADt kinh d\u1ECB n\u1ED5i ti\u1EBFng
    tr\xEAn Internet, th\u01B0\u1EDDng xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n v\u1EDBi th\xE2n h\xECnh
    cao g\u1EA7y, m\u1EB7c vest \u0111en v\xE0 kh\xF4ng c\xF3 khu\xF4n m\u1EB7t.
    Nh\xE2n v\u1EADt n\xE0y b\u1EAFt ngu\u1ED3n t\u1EEB c\xE1c di\u1EC5n \u0111\xE0n
    creepypasta v\xE0 nhanh ch\xF3ng tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng
    c\u1EE7a nh\u1EEFng c\xE2u chuy\u1EC7n r\xF9ng r\u1EE3n tr\xEAn m\u1EA1ng. Slender
    Man th\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c mi\xEAu t\u1EA3 l\xE0 sinh v\u1EADt
    b\xED \u1EA9n chuy\xEAn theo d\xF5i con ng\u01B0\u1EDDi trong r\u1EEBng s\xE2u
    ho\u1EB7c nh\u1EEFng n\u01A1i v\u1EAFng v\u1EBB. Nh\u1EDD v\u1EBB ngo\xE0i \u0111\xE1ng
    s\u1EE3 v\xE0 kh\xF4ng kh\xED b\xED \u1EA9n, nh\xE2n v\u1EADt n\xE0y \u0111\xE3
    xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n trong nhi\u1EC1u game, video v\xE0 meme kinh d\u1ECB n\u1ED5i
    ti\u1EBFng tr\xEAn Internet."
